  "content": "<html><head></head><body><p><a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/laravel-queue-sticky-database-connections\"></a></p>\n                                        <hr>\n\n                    <p>Laravel 13.36 adds Worker::$flushStickyConnections so queue jobs go back to your read replicas after an earlier job writes to the database.</p>\n\n                    <p>The post <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/laravel-queue-sticky-database-connections\">Reset Sticky Database Connections Between Laravel Queue Jobs</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel News</a>.</p>\n                    <p>Join the <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com/newsletter\">Laravel Newsletter</a> to get <a href=\"https://laravel-news.com\">Laravel</a> articles like this directly in your inbox.</p>\n\n                    </body></html>",
